Steps

1) Define the Problem: classification
2) Collect Data (import csv)
3) Preprocess data
  - Data cleaning (remove duplicates, handle missing values)
  - Transform if needed
  - Split dataset into Training Set (80%) and Testing Set(20%)
4) Choose a model (algorithm)
5) Train the model
6) Evaluate the model (Evaluation Metrics)
7) Optional: Tune Hyperparameters
8) Validate the model
9) Optional: Make predictions (test more unseen data)